# Nurturing Pixie: the Pixie targets Thraben Inspector; in response Bot2 kills the Pixie with Lightning Bolt (Mox Ruby,
# turn 2). The trigger is independent of its source (CR 113.7a): the Inspector is still returned to hand, but the Pixie
# is gone and there is nothing to put the counter on (the Pixie in the graveyard is a new object, CR 400.7).

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Plains
Nurturing Pixie
Thraben Inspector
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x16

